{"claim": "Running OpenFold2 NIM on a Slurm-based HPC cluster requires Enroot version 3.4.1 or newer to import and run the NGC container.", "entailment_id": "ent_13e09f235777809d4f956ea4", "evidence": [{"char_end": null, "char_start": null, "chunk_id": "chunk_47f7caad9b294e1d5ea8766f", "quote": null, "source_revision_id": "srcrev_302b7b2101217cf89d4593c4", "support_role": "primary"}], "extractor": {"created_at": "2026-07-09T19:48:59Z", "model": "nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra", "prompt_hash": "sha256:b80359c9bd13fa1670b798243150ba213a8216c26a1f989d5d81ad5fd16d6246", "temperature": 0.2}, "metadata": {"modalities": [], "passage_id": "url_doc_07444ef7cd1ad543b5f21f80", "product_family": "NIM", "source_kinds": [], "source_systems": ["web_crawl"], "source_url": "https://docs.nvidia.com/nim/bionemo/openfold2/latest/prerequisites.html", "stage": "1a"}, "premises": ["The documentation specifies Enroot version 3.4.1 or newer is supported for running OpenFold2 NIM on Slurm.", "The Slurm job script uses enroot import, enroot create, and enroot start commands to manage the container lifecycle.", "Enroot must be available on the login node, verified by enroot version and which enroot commands."], "schema_version": "provenance.v1", "status": "active", "status_reason": null, "supersedes_entailment_id": null, "validator": null}
{"claim": "NGC API key must be exported in the environment before running the Slurm script so Enroot can authenticate and pull the OpenFold2 container image from NGC.", "entailment_id": "ent_9aee0029d935ef31d4a561fa", "evidence": [{"char_end": null, "char_start": null, "chunk_id": "chunk_47f7caad9b294e1d5ea8766f", "quote": null, "source_revision_id": "srcrev_302b7b2101217cf89d4593c4", "support_role": "primary"}], "extractor": {"created_at": "2026-07-09T19:48:59Z", "model": "nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra", "prompt_hash": "sha256:b80359c9bd13fa1670b798243150ba213a8216c26a1f989d5d81ad5fd16d6246", "temperature": 0.2}, "metadata": {"modalities": [], "passage_id": "url_doc_07444ef7cd1ad543b5f21f80", "product_family": "NIM", "source_kinds": [], "source_systems": ["web_crawl"], "source_url": "https://docs.nvidia.com/nim/bionemo/openfold2/latest/prerequisites.html", "stage": "1a"}, "premises": ["The documentation states NGC_API_KEY must be exported before running the Slurm script for Enroot to pull the image from NGC.", "The credentials file for Enroot is created with the NGC API key using machine nvcr.io login $oauthtoken password YOUR_NGC_API_KEY.", "The Slurm script passes NGC_API_KEY as an environment variable to the container via enroot start -e NGC_API_KEY."], "schema_version": "provenance.v1", "status": "active", "status_reason": null, "supersedes_entailment_id": null, "validator": null}
{"claim": "The OpenFold2 NIM container is imported from NGC as a SQSH file using Enroot and stored on shared storage for access across compute nodes.", "entailment_id": "ent_dcaa4d803269d38d73fd1822", "evidence": [{"char_end": null, "char_start": null, "chunk_id": "chunk_47f7caad9b294e1d5ea8766f", "quote": null, "source_revision_id": "srcrev_302b7b2101217cf89d4593c4", "support_role": "primary"}], "extractor": {"created_at": "2026-07-09T19:48:59Z", "model": "nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra", "prompt_hash": "sha256:b80359c9bd13fa1670b798243150ba213a8216c26a1f989d5d81ad5fd16d6246", "temperature": 0.2}, "metadata": {"modalities": [], "passage_id": "url_doc_07444ef7cd1ad543b5f21f80", "product_family": "NIM", "source_kinds": [], "source_systems": ["web_crawl"], "source_url": "https://docs.nvidia.com/nim/bionemo/openfold2/latest/prerequisites.html", "stage": "1a"}, "premises": ["The script imports the Docker image from NGC using enroot import -o ${ACTIVE_SQSH_PATH} ${NGC_IMAGE} where NGC_IMAGE uses docker://nvcr.io#nim/openfold/openfold2:2.4.0 format.", "The SQSH file is saved to ACTIVE_SQSH_PATH on ROOT_DIR which must be on shared storage (Lustre/NFS) visible from compute nodes.", "If the SQSH file already exists, the import step is skipped to avoid re-downloading."], "schema_version": "provenance.v1", "status": "active", "status_reason": null, "supersedes_entailment_id": null, "validator": null}
{"claim": "The Slurm job script mounts shared storage paths for NIM cache, working directory, and temporary files to ensure persistence and accessibility across the HPC cluster.", "entailment_id": "ent_9848b2b134c6ecff436bdb48", "evidence": [{"char_end": null, "char_start": null, "chunk_id": "chunk_47f7caad9b294e1d5ea8766f", "quote": null, "source_revision_id": "srcrev_302b7b2101217cf89d4593c4", "support_role": "primary"}], "extractor": {"created_at": "2026-07-09T19:48:59Z", "model": "nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra", "prompt_hash": "sha256:b80359c9bd13fa1670b798243150ba213a8216c26a1f989d5d81ad5fd16d6246", "temperature": 0.2}, "metadata": {"modalities": [], "passage_id": "url_doc_07444ef7cd1ad543b5f21f80", "product_family": "NIM", "source_kinds": [], "source_systems": ["web_crawl"], "source_url": "https://docs.nvidia.com/nim/bionemo/openfold2/latest/prerequisites.html", "stage": "1a"}, "premises": ["CACHE_PATH on shared storage is mounted to WORKING_CACHE_DIR inside the container for model caching.", "WORKING_PATH on shared storage is mounted to MOUNT_PATH inside the container for project data access.", "TMP_PATH on shared storage is mounted to MOUNT_TMP_PATH inside the container to avoid node-local /tmp quota limits."], "schema_version": "provenance.v1", "status": "active", "status_reason": null, "supersedes_entailment_id": null, "validator": null}
